    "text": "St Tammany Parish\nDriver unharmed after debris crashes through windshield on I-12\n55 minutes ago\nST. TAMMANY PARISH, La. — A driver had a close call on I-12 on Tuesday afternoon when debris from another vehicle struck their windshield and slammed into the dashboard, according to the St. Tammany Parish Fire Protection District No. 1. Despite the impact, the driver was not injured. Photos...",
